---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { getAppBySlug } from "@/data/apps";

const app = getAppBySlug("pipe-flow");
if (!app) {
  throw new Error("Pipe Flow app data is missing.");
}

const updatedAt = "July 8, 2026";
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`${app.name} Privacy Policy - AkuAPPs`}
  description={`Privacy policy for ${app.name}, including closed beta feedback and anonymous level analytics.`}
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-14 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <a class="text-sm font-medium text-teal-200 transition hover:text-white" href={`/apps/${app.slug}`}>
      Back to {app.name}
    </a>

    <div class="mt-8 border-b border-white/10 pb-8">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-zinc-400">Privacy Policy</p>
      <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-black tracking-normal text-white sm:text-5xl">{app.name}</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-zinc-500">Last updated: {updatedAt}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 max-w-none space-y-5 text-base leading-8 text-zinc-300 [&_a]:text-teal-200 [&_a]:transition [&_a:hover]:text-white [&_h2]:pt-5 [&_h2]:text-2xl [&_h2]:font-bold [&_h2]:text-white [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:space-y-2 [&_ul]:pl-6">
      <p>
        This Privacy Policy explains how AkuAPPs handles information for Pipe Flow - High IQ Speed Run.
        The app is currently being prepared for closed beta testing.
      </p>

      <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>
        Pipe Flow does not require account registration and does not ask for your name, email address,
        phone number, contacts, photos, microphone access, or precise location.
      </p>
      <p>During closed beta testing, the app may collect or store the following information:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Anonymous tester or player ID generated by the app.</li>
        <li>Level number, level identifier, app version, and level corpus version.</li>
        <li>Gameplay stats such as completion state, moves, timer values, restarts, undo count, path resets, and board coverage.</li>
        <li>Difficulty ratings submitted by the player after completing a level.</li>
        <li>Issue report category and optional comments submitted by the player.</li>
        <li>Basic technical context such as platform, operating system version, device model, and technical error text when an issue is reported.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How We Use Information</h2>
      <p>We use beta information to operate and improve the game, including to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Improve level difficulty balance and future level ordering.</li>
        <li>Identify impossible, confusing, or unstable levels.</li>
        <li>Fix gameplay, timer, touch input, performance, and user interface issues.</li>
        <li>Understand whether closed beta levels are ready for broader release.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Local Storage and Cloud Services</h2>
      <p>
        The app may store progress, feedback history, difficulty ratings, and gameplay stats locally on your
        device. When Firebase is configured, closed beta feedback and anonymous level analytics may also be
        sent to Firebase/Google Cloud services used by AkuAPPs as the app backend.
      </p>

      <h2>Sharing</h2>
      <p>
        We do not sell user data. Closed beta data may be processed by service providers such as Firebase
        and Google Cloud for hosting, database, security, and app improvement purposes.
      </p>

      <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>
        Pipe Flow is not primarily directed to children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal
        information from children under 13. If you believe a child has provided personal information, please
        contact us so we can review and remove it where appropriate.
      </p>

      <h2>Data Retention and Deletion</h2>
      <p>
        Closed beta feedback and gameplay telemetry may be retained while the game is being tested, balanced,
        and improved. You can request deletion of submitted beta data by contacting AkuAPPs and providing
        your anonymous tester ID if available.
      </p>

      <h2>Security</h2>
      <p>
        We use reasonable technical measures to protect beta data. Firebase communication uses encrypted
        network transport. No method of storage or transmission is perfect, so we cannot guarantee absolute security.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this Privacy Policy as the app moves from closed beta toward public release. The updated
        version will be posted on this page with a new "Last updated" date.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact Us</h2>
      <p>
        For privacy questions or deletion requests about Pipe Flow - High IQ Speed Run, contact AkuAPPs at
        <a href="mailto:hello@akuapps.com"> hello@akuapps.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
